When your document is finished, knit it, open the `.html` in a web browser and **print it to PDF** (*File → Print → Save as PDF*; name it `Group_#_CC7.pdf`). Then copy and paste this into the R Console to stop positpal and create your coding log. **Do not include it as a code chunk.**

```
positpal::stop_capture()
